  unitName: Azure Wanderer Colt
  unitId: 20577
  unitNumber: 1677
  description: Had he survived the battle with the Oracle Knight and his companions,
    Colt might have noticed the conspiracy surrounding the Holy Emperor. In such
    an event, he likely would have pursued his earlier suspicions. In search of the
    truth, he would have braved even the flames of war. In fact, he could have even
    crossed paths with the magician who discovered the god pulling the conspirators'
    strings. Had he uncovered the truth, it seems certain that Colt would have fought
    to the death to defend both humanity and his personal faith.
  summonDesc: If my sister were here now...<br>No, I've decided to go my own way.
    I've just got to do what I can for now!
  fusionDesc: With all that has happened, I feel like I'm turning into someone else...
    You're the only one I can count on.
  evoDesc: I was wrong about where I was needed. That's why I have to get it right
    this time!
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
